<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Team Task Manager</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..40,400;0,9..40,600;0,9..40,700&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css" />
    <style>
      .landing {
        max-width: 560px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 4rem 1.25rem 3rem;
        text-align: center;
      }
      .landing-badge {
        display: inline-block;
        font-size: 0.7rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.12em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        padding: 0.25rem 0.55rem;
        border-radius: 999px;
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        color: var(--muted);
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }
      .landing h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 2.6rem);
        margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
        letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      }
      .landing p.lead {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        margin: 0 0 2rem;
      }
      .feature-row {
        display: grid;
        gap: 0.65rem;
        text-align: left;
        margin: 2rem 0;
      }
      .feature {
        border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--radius);
        padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
        background: var(--bg-card);
      }
      .feature strong {
        display: block;
        margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
      }
      .feature span {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.88rem;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="landing">
      <div class="landing-badge">Full-stack assessment</div>
      <h1>Team Task Manager</h1>
      <p class="lead">Create projects, assign tasks to members, and watch progress on a live dashboard—with role-based access for admins and members.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn" href="/signup">Create account</a>
        <a class="btn secondary" href="/login">Log in</a>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-row">
        <div class="feature">
          <strong>Secure auth</strong>
          <span>JWT in an HTTP-only cookie; session-aware API calls from the browser.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <strong>Projects & teams</strong>
          <span>Admins create initiatives and add collaborators by user ID.</span>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <strong>Interactive tasks</strong>
          <span>Filter, search, and update status inline; overdue work is highlighted.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="link-muted">Already signed in? <a href="/app">Open the app</a></p>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
